TITLE Albite kinetics with H2S gas
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    Fe(3) 4
    Fe(2) 4
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure true
    -pressure 5
    H2S(g) 5
KINETICS 1
    Albite
        -m0 1
        -m 1
        -parms 1.0 10
        -steps 1000 in 100
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.txt
    -reset false
    -step true
    -time true
    -totals Ba Fe(2) Fe(3) Na Al Si S(-2) S(6)
    -molalities Ba+2
END
